   "rendered": "About us"
  },
  "content": {
   "rendered": "<p>We are a team of eight engineers and installers. Every installation is surveyed, designed and wired by our own staff, and we stay on call for the life of the system.</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://solar.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/team.png\" alt=\"The installation team on a roof\"><figcaption>The team in October.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>How we work</h2>\n<ul><li>A free site survey</li><li>A written design and quote</li><li>Installation in two days</li></ul>",
   "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
   "rendered": "<p>Who we are and how we work.</p>\n",
